{
  "id": "A54",
  "goal": "INC03-CC-003-A3",
  "title": "Personal answer control: the owner cancels or replaces an admitted automatic answer, and reads the controlled conversation, its inputs and their withheld answers, versioned",
  "why": [
    "SOPHIA-INC-2026-11 INC-03, INC03-CC-003 A3 (AC03-12 backend): the HTTP boundary of migration 0103. Its generated output is regenerated with `pnpm --filter @sophia/contracts generate`, never by hand.",
    "New paths and versioned schemas only. A10, A52 and A53 are unchanged: their bodies, routes, receipts and replay bytes mean what they meant, no A53 decision is appended or reinterpreted, and no old enum is widened. A space with controlled inputs is read only through these reads; the old unversioned reads refuse it (503 projection_unavailable) rather than show a turn they cannot represent.",
    "Control is its own revisioned state, independent of A53's decision sequence, so an input admitted at decision seq 100 is still controllable. Every write names its key, its epoch and the revision it expects; a replay returns its remembered receipt, a refused admission included, before any flag or profile is read.",
    "Served whenever 0103 is installed: cancel, the reads, the log, the export and replay need neither personalAnswers nor the replacement admission gate, nor a live companion. Only a fresh admission of a replacement needs personalAnswers and personalAnswerReplacementAdmission (both off by default) and the companion's current profile.",
    "Nothing here undoes an external effect: possible means possibly external, not sent; a settled cost is not a recovered answer; an answer of withdrawn work is withheld for its owner, never published."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/PersonalAnswerControlRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "controlContract": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["personal_answer_control_v1"]
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["cancel", "replace"]
          },
          "expectedRevision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1000
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4000
          }
        },
        "required": ["controlContract", "action", "expectedRevision"],
        "description": "A control of the owner's own automatic answer input, under its own key and the control revision it expects (0 for an input never controlled). cancel withdraws it; replace withdraws it and keeps `text` as a new correlated input (text is required for replace and refused for cancel: 422). Closed: no profile, payer, route, model, audience or project."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/PersonalAnswerAdmitRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "controlContract": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["personal_answer_control_v1"]
          },
          "controlId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "expectedRevision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1000
          }
        },
        "required": ["controlContract", "controlId", "expectedRevision"],
        "description": "The owner's explicit admission of a held replacement: the path names the replacement, controlId the owner's own replace that created it."
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/PersonalAnswerPrior",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "financial": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["none", "unresolved", "settled"]
          },
          "effect": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["none", "possible"]
          },
          "answer": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["none", "in_progress", "published", "kept_unpublished", "withheld", "no_answer", "unknown"]
          }
        },
        "required": ["financial", "effect", "answer"],
        "description": "What the original's calls stand at: their money (none bound, any unresolved, or all settled or released), whether any may have had an external effect (possible is not proof that anything was sent), and what became of the answer. A settled cost is not a recovered answer: unknown stays unknown."
      }
    },
